    🔡 check 🔤and says what is🔤 🏷🐇🔬🔸🧭 headPost 🔤Allow🔤❗️ 🔤POST, OPTIONS🔤❗️

    💭 OPTIONS
    🧪🐇🔬🔸🧭 app 🔤OPTIONS🔤 🔤/inspect🔤❗️ ➡️ options
    🔢 check 🔤OPTIONS is answered automatically🔤 🚥 options❗️ 204❗️
    🔡 check 🔤OPTIONS lists every method of the path🔤 🏷🐇🔬🔸🧭 options 🔤Allow🔤❗️ everything❗️
    🔡 check 🔤OPTIONS has no body🔤 📄 options❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
