    🧪🐇🔬🔸🧭 app 🔤OPTIONS🔤 🔤/🔤❗️ ➡️ optionsGet
    🔡 check 🔤OPTIONS on a GET-only path adds HEAD🔤 🏷🐇🔬🔸🧭 optionsGet 🔤Allow🔤❗️ 🔤GET, HEAD, OPTIONS🔤❗️
