    🔡 check 🔤404 has no Allow🔤 🏷🐇🔬🔸🧭 missing 🔤Allow🔤❗️ 🔤(none)🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤404 is a problem too🔤 📄 missing❗️ 🔤{"type":"about:blank","title":"Not Found","status":404,"detail":"No route for GET /nope"}🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤of the same media type🔤 🏷🐇🔬🔸🧭 missing 🔤Content-Type🔤❗️ 🔤application/problem+json; charset=utf-8🔤❗️
    🔢 check 🔤a target that cannot be decoded is 400🔤 🚥 🧪🐇🔬🔸🧭 app 🔤GET🔤 🔤/inspect/%zz🔤❗️❗️ 400❗️

